<title>USA: Brazil's Banco de Boston names originations head.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Banco de Boston names originations head.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Boston Corp said on Thursday its Brazilian subsidiary, Banco de Boston, named Claudio Citrin head of capital markets origination in Brazil.</p>
<p>Before joining Banco de Boston, Citrin led a Brazilian originations team at Chase Manhattan Corp, Bank of Boston said. His team there specialized in metals, chemicals, forest products and food industries, the bank said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
